fin-market-structure:MarketInfrastructureComponentShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "Market Infrastructure Component, is the abstract base class for a section or component of an operating market infrastructure entity, used to model the ISO 10383 \"section\" semantics (a part of a market, exchange, or reporting facility) as a component rather than as an independent facility, while allowing concrete components to share a facility supertype for reference range where useful.";
