    sh:description "Trading Schedule Override Notice, is a temporal provenance-bearing n-ary association that records one pre-announced schedule override applying to one or more exact TradingSessionOccurrence versions under one exact calendar and one exact facility, carrying an announcement order and a supersession order together with an optional replacement interval, used to separate the planned schedule from real-time status and to deterministically synthesize a single final effective interval or cancellation across multiple affected sessions.";
