    sh:description "Trading Session Template, is a local-clock recurring session specification attached to one exact TradingCalendar version, used to define repeatedly applicable session start, end, phase, and recurrence rules that deterministically materialize into UTC half-open occurrence intervals under the calendar's IANA time zone.";
